     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><a href=\"https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/treeio/blob/master/R/method-drop-tip.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/treeio/blob/master/R/method-drop-tip.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482710679000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0g1O5ynU4aArRk3aU7kOZf\">drop.tip</a> is supported in <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">treeio</code>.</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:W2Ryb3AudGlwXShodHRwczovL2dpdGh1Yi5jb20vR3VhbmdjaHVhbmdZdS90cmVlaW8vYmxvYi9t\r\nYXN0ZXIvUi9tZXRob2QtZHJvcC10aXAuUikgaXMgc3VwcG9ydGVkIGluIGB0cmVlaW9gLjxicj48\r\nYnI+\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
